  <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl max-w-sm w-full p-6 text-center shadow-2xl border border-slate-200">
    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-rose-100 text-rose-600 mx-auto flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
      <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 7l-.867 12.142A2 2 0 0116.138 21H7.862a2 2 0 01-1.995-1.858L5 7m5 4v6m4-6v6m1-10V4a1 1 0 00-1-1h-4a1 1 0 00-1 1v3M4 7h16"></path></svg>
    </div>
    <h3 class="text-lg font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-2">Hapus Menu Ini?</h3>
    <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mb-6">
      Menu <strong id="delete-item-name" class="text-slate-800"></strong> akan dihapus permanen dari database PostgreSQL.
    </p>
    <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3">
      <button onclick="closeDeleteModal()" class="px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 text-xs font-bold text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-50">
        Batal
      </button>
      <button onclick="executeDelete()" id="btn-confirm-delete" class="px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-rose-600 hover:bg-rose-700 text-white text-xs font-bold shadow-md shadow-rose-500/20">
        Ya, Hapus Permanen
      </button>
